  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Cache Service & Persistence (LuciferCore.Service):\n      - Added a high-performance in-memory Cache Service optimized for Data-Oriented Design (DOD).\n      - Implemented Zero-Allocation I/O: Leverages Span<T> and Stream.ReadExactly for direct persistence to \"cache.dat\" without GC pressure.\n      - Advanced Thread-Safety: Utilizes fine-grained locking per CacheEntry combined with Atomic flags (Interlocked) for non-blocking concurrent access.\n      - Manual Memory Management: Fully integrated with LuciferCore.Pool.Buffer, featuring precise Reference Counting (IncrementRef/Dispose) to prevent leaks in high-throughput scenarios.\n      - Integrated Query Engine (LINQ-friendly):\n      * Added GetAll, WherePrefix, and WhereContains for flexible data retrieval.\n      * Specialized ID-based querying: Extracted from UTF-8 keys (WhereIdEquals, WhereIdGreaterThan, WhereIdBetween, OrderById) using optimized Utf8Parser.\n      * Sliding Expiration: Automatic TTL extension on access, fully persistent across service restarts.\n      - Safety & Robustness: Implemented safety limits (MaxKeyBytes, MaxValueBytes) to prevent OOM on corrupted cache files and structured Error Handling for File I/O.",
